---
pagination:
  data: operators
  size: 1
  alias: operator
permalink: "/redemption-times/{{ operator.slug }}/index.html"
layout: base.njk
tags: ["operatorPages"]
ogType: "article"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ operator.name }} Free SC, Offers and Redemption Requirements"
  description: "{{ operator.name }} signup SC, first-purchase offer, redemption minimums and playthrough, with source-linked conditions and published payout terms."
  jsonld:
    "@context": "https://schema.org"
    "@graph":
      - "@type": "Article"
        "@id": "https://socialcasinoindex.com/redemption-times/{{ operator.slug }}/#article"
        headline: "{{ operator.name }} Offers and Redemption Requirements"
        description: "{{ operator.name }} signup SC, first-purchase offer, redemption minimums and playthrough, with source-linked conditions."
        datePublished: "{{ operator.verifiedAt }}"
        dateModified: "{{ operator.verifiedAt | latestDate(contentDates.operatorPages, benchmarks.generatedAt, '2026-09-21') }}"
        mainEntityOfPage: "https://socialcasinoindex.com/redemption-times/{{ operator.slug }}/"
        author:
          "@id": "https://socialcasinoindex.com/#alex-rowan"
        publisher:
          "@id": "https://socialcasinoindex.com/#org"
      - "@type": "BreadcrumbList"
        itemListElement:
          - "@type": "ListItem"
            position: 1
            name: "Home"
            item: "https://socialcasinoindex.com/"
          - "@type": "ListItem"
            position: 2
            name: "Redemption times"
            item: "https://socialcasinoindex.com/redemption-times/"
          - "@type": "ListItem"
            position: 3
            name: "{{ operator.name }}"
---
{% from "benefit-row.njk" import evidence %}
<main><article class="wrap py-10">
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/redemption-times/">Redemption times</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">{{ operator.name }}</span></li></ol></nav>
  <p class="eyebrow">Operator record · Published benefits</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">{{ operator.name }} Offers and Redemption Requirements</h1>
  <p class="lede">{% if current.productMode == "entertainment_only" %}Entertainment-only Gold Coin play. These coins are not included in the cash-benefit benchmarks.{% else %}Published offers and redemption requirements, with the source and observation date attached to each figure.{% endif %}</p>
  {% if current.rank %}<p>Published-offer rank <strong>{{ current.rank }}</strong> · Score {{ current.score | round(1) }}/100. <a href="/methodology/#published-offers">How we compare</a>.</p>{% endif %}
  <div class="benefit-detail-grid">
  {% for key, label in { signup: "Immediate free signup", welcome: "Advertised welcome reward", staged: "Staged free welcome reward", purchase: "Purchase package", daily: "Recurring daily reward", cash: "Cash redemption minimum", general: "General redemption minimum", gift: "Gift-card minimum" } %}
    {% if current.metrics[key] %}<section data-metric="{{ key }}"><h2>{{ label }}</h2>{{ evidence(current.metrics[key]) }}</section>{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if not current.benefitCount %}<p>{{ current.status }}. Missing collected values do not establish that an operator lacks an offer.</p>{% endif %}
  <nav class="benefit-nav" aria-label="Bonus benchmarks">{% for benchmark in benchmarks.benchmarks %}{% if current.metrics[benchmark.id] %}<a href="{{ benchmark.url }}">Compare {{ benchmark.title | lower }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</nav>
  <section id="redemption-answer">
    <h2>{{ operator.name }} redemption requirements</h2>
    {% if current.metrics.cash %}<p>Published cash redemption minimum: <strong>{{ current.metrics.cash.label }}</strong>.</p>{% elif current.metrics.general %}<p>Published general redemption minimum: <strong>{{ current.metrics.general.label }}</strong>. A cash-specific threshold is not established by this observation.</p>{% else %}<p>A cash redemption minimum has not been established in the collected evidence.</p>{% endif %}
    {% for policy in current.product.policies %}
      <section data-policy-record="{{ policy.recordId }}"><h3>{{ policy.field | replace("_", " ") | capitalize }}</h3>{{ evidence(policy, true) }}</section>
    {% endfor %}
    {% if current.product.daily and not current.metrics.daily %}<section><h3>Daily reward</h3>{{ evidence(current.product.daily, true) }}</section>{% endif %}
    {% if current.product.verification.length %}<h3>Identity checks</h3>{% for requirement in current.product.verification %}{{ evidence(requirement, true) }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}
  </section>
  <h2>Funded test status</h2>
  <p>
{% if operator.testStatus == "completed" %}
    <span class="badge completed"><i class="ph ph-seal-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Completed funded test</span>
{% elif operator.testStatus == "pending" %}
    <span class="badge pending"><i class="ph ph-hourglass-medium" aria-hidden="true"></i> Funded test pending</span>
{% else %}
    <span class="badge nottested"><i class="ph ph-clock-clockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i> Not tested yet</span>
{% endif %}
  </p>
{% if operator.testStatus == "completed" and operator.observedResult %}
  <p>We funded an account and timed a real redemption: {{ operator.observedResult.type }} redemption by {{ operator.observedResult.method }}, requested {{ operator.observedResult.requestedAt | readableDate }}, received {{ operator.observedResult.receivedAt | readableDate }} ({{ operator.observedResult.businessDays }} business days){% if operator.observedResult.notes %}. {{ operator.observedResult.notes }}{% endif %}.</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Observed figures come from our own funded test and are shown separately from the operator's published terms below. A single test does not make a ranking; see the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</p>
{% elif operator.testStatus == "pending" %}
  <p>A funded redemption test with {{ operator.name }} is pending. No measured result is available. <a href="/methodology/">How funded testing works</a>.</p>
{% else %}
  <p>We have not funded an account with {{ operator.name }} yet. Every figure on this page is a published term from the operator's own documents, not a measured result. <a href="/methodology/">How funded testing works</a>.</p>
{% endif %}
  <h2 id="availability">Availability</h2>
  <p>{{ operator.availability }}</p>
  {% if operator.restrictedStates.length %}<p><strong>Existing exclusions retained by the site's state gate:</strong> {{ operator.restrictedStates | join(", ") }}. This list was not reverified in the offer review and does not establish availability elsewhere.</p>{% endif %}
  <p>Check the site's offer policy and separate legal-source notes in the <a href="/availability/#closed-states">state availability index</a>. Operator acceptance does not establish legality.</p>
  <h2>Compare payout methods</h2>
  <p>For the request process, read <a href="/guides/how-to-redeem-sweeps-coins/">how to redeem Sweeps Coins</a>.</p>
  <p>Compare the methods in detail: <a href="/guides/redemption-methods/bank-transfer/">bank transfer</a>, <a href="/guides/redemption-methods/gift-card/">gift card</a> and <a href="/guides/redemption-methods/crypto/">cryptocurrency</a>, or read the <a href="/research/sweepstakes-casino-redemption-times/">full redemption-time research</a>.</p>
  {% if operator.partner %}
  <div class="cta-box" data-cta-operator="{{ operator.slug }}">
    <p class="cta-title">Check {{ operator.name }}</p>
    <p class="cta-msg">Confirm your state and the live offer before creating an account.</p>
    <a class="cta-btn" href="/go/{{ operator.slug }}/">Visit {{ operator.name }} <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  <h2 id="sources">Sources and verification</h2>
  <p>
    {% if current.product.lastCheckedAt %}<span class="badge nottested"><i class="ph ph-clock-clockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i> Last attempted check {{ current.product.lastCheckedAt | readableDate }}</span>{% endif %}
  </p>
  <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">The review date records the evidence check, not a guarantee that every field was verified. Some public pages were retrieved from a US location to resolve regional access blocks; this does not establish player eligibility. Blocked pages document an evidence gap and do not support numeric claims.</p>
  <ol class="sources">{% for source in current.product.sources %}<li id="source-{{ source.id }}"><a href="{{ source.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ source.url | replace("https://", "") }}</a>. <span class="accessed">Checked {{ source.checkedAt | readableDate }}. {{ source.status | replace("_", " ") }}.</span></li>{% endfor %}</ol>
  <p class="byline mt-8"><a href="/redemption-times/">Compare all operators</a> · <a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a> · <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate disclosure</a></p>
</article></main>
